            "value" : "Als je pup bevriest, lok hem dan vooruit met snoepjes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If puppy pulls, stop immediately. Wait for loose leash, then cue and continue. Change direction frequently to keep attention on you." : {
      "comment" : "Training module string for handling situations where a puppy pulls during a loose leash walk.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "If puppy pulls, stop walking immediately" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn der Welpe zieht, sofort stehen bleiben"
