    "If puppy stares constantly, toss the treat behind them to break eye contact" : {
      "comment" : "Tip for Training.Skills.watchMeTip2.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je pup constant staart, gooi het snoepje achter ze om het oogcontact te verbreken"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If recall fails, don't repeat the command. Wait, reward any movement toward you, and make the exercise easier next time" : {
      "comment" : "Tip for Training.Skills.comeHowTo5.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als terugroepen mislukt, herhaal het commando niet. Wacht, beloon elke beweging naar je toe, en maak de oefening de volgende keer makkelijker"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If recall fails, don't repeat the word. Walk closer, show the treat, and try again later with less distraction. Protect the magic word's power" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als de terugroep mislukt, herhaal het woord niet. Loop dichterbij, laat de beloning zien, en probeer het later opnieuw met minder afleiding. Bescherm de kracht van het toverwoord"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If they break, simply reset without punishment" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn er abbricht, einfach ohne Strafe neu beginnen"
