    },
    "If your dog fails more than twice in a row, make the exercise easier. Success builds confidence and keeps training fun." : {
      "comment" : "Advice on what to do if a training session is not going well.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "If your puppy backs up instead of sitting, practice with their back against a wall or in a corner - the only option becomes sitting down" : {
      "comment" : "Tip for the \"Sit\" skill, emphasizing the importance of practicing in a safe and controlled environment to ensure the puppy responds correctly.",
