    "Practice in new location" : {
      "comment" : "Label for a skill in the Training module that indicates it should be practiced in a new context.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Practice in new locations: backyard, front yard, quiet park. Always use a long line until 100% reliable. Vary the distance and your body position." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oefen op nieuwe locaties: achtertuin, voortuin, rustig park. Gebruik altijd een lange lijn tot 100% betrouwbaar. Varieer de afstand en je lichaamshouding."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Practice in new locations: kitchen, garden, front door, quiet street, park. Each new place is like starting over - use the lure again if needed, then fade it." : {
      "comment" : "Training module skill content - how to practice in new locations.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oefen op nieuwe locaties: keuken, tuin, voordeur, rustige straat, park. Elke nieuwe plek is als opnieuw beginnen - gebruik het lokmiddel opnieuw indien nodig, en laat het dan vervagen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Practice in new places, add distractions gradually" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oefen op nieuwe plekken, voeg geleidelijk afleiding toe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Practice in progressively challenging environments: different rooms, backyard, front yard, quiet park, busier areas. Always use a long line until 100% reliable." : {
