        }
      }
    },
    "Teach essential commands" : {
      "comment" : "Description of the skills section in the training tab.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leer essentiële commando's"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teach your puppy that the click sound means a treat is coming. This is the foundation for all marker-based training." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bringe deinem Welpen bei, dass das Klickgerausch bedeutet, dass ein Leckerli kommt. Das ist die Grundlage fur alles Marker-basierte Training."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enseña a tu cachorro que el sonido del clic significa que viene un premio. Esta es la base de todo el entrenamiento con marcador."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apprenez à votre chiot que le son du clic signifie qu'une friandise arrive. C'est la base de tout entraînement basé sur un marqueur."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Insegna al tuo cucciolo che il suono del click significa che arriva un premietto. Questa è la base per tutto l'addestramento con marker."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leer je pup dat het klikgeluid betekent dat er een snoepje aankomt. Dit is de basis voor alle markertraining."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test the association: say the magic word when your dog is slightly distracted. If they whip around excitedly, you're ready for the next phase." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Test de associatie: zeg het toverwoord als je hond lichtjes afgeleid is. Als ze opgewonden omdraaien, ben je klaar voor de volgende fase."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test: click when puppy looks away. If they turn to you expecting food, it's working" : {
      "comment" : "Test question for clicker training, asking the user to click the clicker when their puppy looks away, and to check if they turn to them expecting food, indicating that the training is working.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Test: klik wanneer je pup wegkijkt. Als ze naar je draaien en eten verwachten, werkt het"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tether puppy (table leg). Lure diagonally down and away - puppy can't follow, must lie down. Wait patiently" : {
      "comment" : "How-to step for training a puppy to lie down using a lure.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bind je pup vast (tafelpoot). Lok diagonaal naar beneden en weg - pup kan niet volgen, moet gaan liggen. Wacht geduldig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 3 D's: Duration, Distance, Distraction - only increase one at a time" : {
      "comment" : "Tip for the \"Loose Leash Walking\" skill, encouraging the user to only increase one skill aspect at a time.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The first 16 weeks are critical. Track exposures to people, animals, sounds, and environments to raise a confident dog." : {
      "comment" : "Message for the Socialization section tip.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die ersten 16 Wochen sind entscheidend. Verfolge Begegnungen mit Menschen, Tieren, Geräuschen und Umgebungen, um einen selbstbewussten Hund aufzuziehen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las primeras 16 semanas son críticas. Registra las exposiciones a personas, animales, sonidos y entornos para criar un perro seguro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les 16 premières semaines sont cruciales. Suivez les expositions aux personnes, animaux, sons et environnements pour élever un chien confiant."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le prime 16 settimane sono critiche. Traccia le esposizioni a persone, animali, suoni e ambienti per crescere un cane sicuro."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De eerste 16 weken zijn cruciaal. Volg blootstellingen aan mensen, dieren, geluiden en omgevingen om een zelfverzekerde hond op te voeden."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De första 16 veckorna är kritiska. Följ exponeringar för människor, djur, ljud och miljöer för att uppfostra en trygg hund."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The classic sit command. A building block for many other behaviors." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das klassische Sitz-Kommando. Ein Baustein fur viele andere Verhaltensweisen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La orden clásica de sentarse. Un pilar fundamental para muchos otros comportamientos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La commande assis classique. Une base pour de nombreux autres comportements."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il classico comando seduto. Un mattone fondamentale per molti altri comportamenti."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het klassieke zit-commando. Een bouwsteen voor veel ander gedrag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The click is a marker signal that tells your puppy exactly when they did something right. It bridges the gap between the behavior and the reward. Timing is everything — you must click at the precise moment the correct behavior happens, not a second before or after." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of the importance of timing in click training.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The click marks the exact moment of correct behavior" : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of click timing in the Training module.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The click marks the exact moment of correct behavior. Always reward within 1-2 seconds of clicking." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the timing aspect of the training principles.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The click must ALWAYS be followed by a treat" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf den Klick muss IMMER ein Leckerli folgen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El clic SIEMPRE debe ir seguido de un premio"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le clic doit TOUJOURS être suivi d'une friandise"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al click deve SEMPRE seguire un premietto"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Op de klik moet ALTIJD een snoepje volgen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The click must ALWAYS be followed by a treat - this is a fundamental rule" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De klik moet ALTIJD gevolgd worden door een snoepje - dit is een fundamentele regel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The click signals 'well done, you can relax now'. Don't expect the dog to hold position after clicking." : {
      "comment" : "Description of a training rule where the click signals that the dog can relax.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The clicker is a marker signal that tells your puppy exactly when they did something right. It bridges the gap between the behavior and the reward." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De klikker is een markersignaal dat je pup precies vertelt wanneer ze iets goed deden. Het overbrugt de kloof tussen het gedrag en de beloning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The easiest and most useful command. A puppy who sits can't jump up at the same time - it replaces unwanted behavior naturally. You'll use this dozens of times every day." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the \"Sit\" command.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het makkelijkste en nuttigste commando. Een pup die zit, kan niet tegelijk opspringen - het vervangt ongewenst gedrag op een natuurlijke manier. Je gebruikt dit tientallen keren per dag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The magic word works because it's never 'polluted' by everyday use. Your dog's name and 'come' have been said thousands of times with no reward — they've learned to tune them out" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het toverwoord werkt omdat het nooit 'vervuild' is door dagelijks gebruik. De naam van je hond en 'kom' zijn duizenden keren gezegd zonder beloning — ze hebben geleerd om het te negeren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The moment their bottom touches the floor: mark ('yes!' or click) and give the treat. Repeat 5-8 times per session." : {
      "comment" : "How-to step for the \"Sit\" skill: marking and rewarding the puppy when they sit.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Op het moment dat hun achterwerk de grond raakt: markeer ('goed zo!' of klik) en geef het snoepje. Herhaal 5-8 keer per sessie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The moment they look at your eyes, click and treat" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sobald er in deine Augen schaut, klicken und belohnen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En el momento que mire a tus ojos, haz clic y premia"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dès qu'il regarde vos yeux, cliquez et récompensez"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nel momento in cui guarda nei tuoi occhi, clicca e premia"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Op het moment dat hij naar je ogen kijkt, klik en geef een snoepje"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The three Ds: Duration, Distance, Distraction - increase one at a time" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die drei Ds: Dauer, Distanz, Ablenkung - jeweils eines erhohen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las tres D: Duración, Distancia, Distracción - aumenta una a la vez"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les trois D : Durée, Distance, Distraction - augmentez un à la fois"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le tre D: Durata, Distanza, Distrazione - aumenta una alla volta"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De drie D's: Duur, Afstand, Afleiding - verhoog er één tegelijk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The word should be short (1-2 syllables), easy to say with excitement, and completely unique to recall. Never use it casually. This word = jackpot treat, always." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het woord moet kort zijn (1-2 lettergrepen), makkelijk enthousiast uit te spreken, en volledig uniek voor terugroepen. Gebruik het nooit zomaar. Dit woord = jackpot beloning, altijd."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then add distance (stay far but shorter)" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dann Distanz hinzufugen (weit weg, aber kurzer)"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Luego añade distancia (quédate lejos pero menos tiempo)"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puis ajoutez la distance (restez loin mais moins longtemps)"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poi aggiungi distanza (resta lontano ma per meno tempo)"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voeg dan afstand toe (blijf ver maar korter)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then slowly pull treat away from puppy along floor" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dann Leckerli langsam vom Welpen weg uber den Boden ziehen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Luego aleja lentamente el premio del cachorro por el suelo"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puis tirez lentement la friandise le long du sol"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poi trascina lentamente il premietto lontano dal cucciolo lungo il pavimento"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trek het snoepje dan langzaam over de grond van je pup weg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These skills need attention" : {
      "comment" : "Subtitle for a section in the Training.SessionPlan view that lists skills that need more focus.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "They learn to settle and self-soothe instead of getting overtired and hyper" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
