        }
      }
    },
    "This is totally normal! Dogs often need refreshers, especially during adolescence. A few quick sessions will get things back on track." : {
      "comment" : "A friendly, non-alarming message explaining that some skills may need more practice than others.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
